{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484100/extras/be14147ed84f409abfc96e76dbefe8e9.avif?t=1758266565\" width=800 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484100/extras/3c991c44c5882585a9425c7ab0070810.poster.avif?t=1758266565\" width=592 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484100/extras/3c991c44c5882585a9425c7ab0070810.webm?t=1758266565\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Effortless One-Handed Play</strong><br>Weapons attack automatically, and the character is equipped with blink and sprint abilities, ensuring easy controls and intuitive gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul Orb System</strong><br>Each weapon slot comes with its own unique attributes. Combine various weapons strategically to create the perfect loadout for any situation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Support Items</strong><br>Support items affect adjacent weapons, offering countless possibilities for creative combinations. Experience both strategy and fun in every battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dungeon Exploration</strong><br>Beyond combat, discover exciting rooms and hidden chambers within the dungeon, adding a sense of adventure and exploration to the gameplay.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3484100?t=1758266565","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3484100/page_bg_raw